        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9308, Elongated Ridged Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love this knob for its sophisticated styling. The Fancy Ridged Cabinet Knob made by RK International features a very classy lined design that adds interest to its elongated shape. It is available in two sizes: 1-3/4 inches long and 2-1/4 inches long. Choose any of the 5 available finishes for a truly beautiful finishing touch to your cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/fancy-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3718\"><b>Fancy Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-drop-pull-rk-international-cp-3721\"><b>Fancy Ridged Drop Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/fancy-ribbed-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4718\"><b>12 Inch Fancy Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9308 Solid Brass Fancy Lined Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9308:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-9309:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
